  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.145` to `4.1.147`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.145...application_builder_helpers/4.1.147)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): symmetric help/version forgiveness plus global version footer (Fixes #595) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/620\n* cli: default sink policy keeps lifetime logs off stdout (Fixes #604) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/624\n* cli: single-letter Term auto-alias via shared ResolveShortName (Fixes #605) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/626\n* fix(cli): isolate external abort from hosting lifetime output (Fixes #603) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/625\n* fix(cli): unknown option takes precedence over help regardless of order (Fixes #607) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/627\n* docs(cli): clarify exact option-name matching, CaseSensitive values-only by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/628\n* feat(cli): add @response-file expansion to argv (Fixes #606) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/629\n* fix(cli): true global flags bind at any position by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/630\n* docs: clarify FromServices shim requirement (Fixes #632) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/641\n* docs: add missing using directives to configuration snippets by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/640\n* cli: gate concrete-root miss before positional bind (Fixes #631) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/644\n* fix(cli): reserve help/version in DidYouMean ranking (Fixes #635) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/643\n* fix(cli): fail-closed DidYouMean blame-token and subcommand gates by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/642\n* fix(cli): synthetic parent help + force routing by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/645\n* fix(cli): bind FromAmong-matched strings in canonical casing (Fixes #637) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/646\n* fix(cli): bare-only boolean flags (Fixes #602) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/647\n* fix(cli): uniform usage-error kinds and footers (Fixes #636) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/648\n* fix(cli): help-width floor and piped-theme docs (Fixes #638) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/649\n* docs: clarify starter templates are copy-only and add discovery pointers by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/650\n* fix(cli): leading-help miss uniformity by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/663\n* fix(cli): owner-only unknown-option footer (Fixes #652) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/662\n* cli: gate help/version forgiveness on FromAmong probe by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/664\n* fix(cli): centralize leaf-owned option scope authority (Fixes #651) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/666\n* docs: add missing using directives (Fixes #657) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/667\n* fix(cli): reserved help/version =-forms use bare-only text (Refs #655) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/668\n* docs: Required means present not non-empty (Refs #658) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/669\n* fix(cli): route short clusters in pre-subcommand path walk by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/670\n* cli: always show redacted secret default in help (Fixes #660) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/671\n* fix(cli): narrow -H hint plus list -? in help (Fixes #659) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/672\n* fix(cli): per-type parser hints + help-width ceiling (Fixes #661) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/673\n* Bump coverlet.collector from 10.0.1 to 10.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/589\n* Bump Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp from 4.14.0 to 5.9.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/590\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261001103733.6353458...build.20261006042727.276c4c7",
